                                                    </div>
                                                    </apex:outputPanel>
                                                    <apex:outputPanel rendered="{! IF(batchCountOnNotesJSON == null, true,false)}"><p> <p>Batch is not scheduled.Kindly reschedule the batch using below Step</p><p>1. Go to Developer Console</p>
                                                    <p>2. Execute the below command in Asynchronous Window</p> <p> system.schedule({!SchClassid},'{!CronExpressn}',new ({!SchClassid}));</p></p></apex:outputPanel>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </apex:outputPanel>
